sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title HackMatch — US-030: Core Chat MVP — Sequence Diagram (Planned)
    actor PART
    participant ReactChatUI
    participant AuthGuards
    participant ExpressAPI
    participant PostgreSQL

    PART->>ReactChatUI: Open Chat
    ReactChatUI->>AuthGuards: Request protected chat access
    AuthGuards->>AuthGuards: Verify token, PART role, verification, and active account
    alt Visitor, non-PART, unverified, or suspended
        AuthGuards-->>ReactChatUI: Deny access without chat data
        ReactChatUI-->>PART: Show gated or error state
    else Verified active PART
        AuthGuards->>ExpressAPI: Request channel list
        ExpressAPI->>PostgreSQL: Query channels in stable order
        PostgreSQL-->>ExpressAPI: Channel rows or empty result
        ExpressAPI-->>ReactChatUI: Safe channel projection
        ReactChatUI-->>PART: Show loading, then channel list or empty state
    end

    PART->>ReactChatUI: Submit title and description
    ReactChatUI->>ExpressAPI: Submit channel draft
    ExpressAPI->>ExpressAPI: Validate nonblank title and description
    alt Invalid channel input
        ExpressAPI-->>ReactChatUI: Validation error and retained channel draft
    else Valid channel input
        ExpressAPI->>PostgreSQL: Persist channel and creator
        alt Channel persistence fails
            PostgreSQL-->>ExpressAPI: Storage failure
            ExpressAPI-->>ReactChatUI: Error and retained channel draft
        else Channel persists
            PostgreSQL-->>ExpressAPI: Created channel
            ExpressAPI-->>ReactChatUI: Safe created-channel result
        end
    end

    PART->>ReactChatUI: Open authorized channel
    ReactChatUI->>ExpressAPI: Request channel messages
    ExpressAPI->>ExpressAPI: Enforce authorized PART / channel-member rule
    ExpressAPI->>PostgreSQL: Query channel messages and handles
    PostgreSQL-->>ExpressAPI: Message rows or empty result
    ExpressAPI-->>ReactChatUI: Handle, UTC time, and content only
    ReactChatUI-->>PART: Show loading, then messages or empty state

    PART->>ReactChatUI: Submit message
    ReactChatUI->>ExpressAPI: Submit composer draft
    ExpressAPI->>ExpressAPI: Validate nonblank message body
    alt Invalid message body
        ExpressAPI-->>ReactChatUI: Validation error and retained composer draft
    else Valid message body
        ExpressAPI->>PostgreSQL: Persist channel, author, body, and UTC time
        alt Message persistence fails
            PostgreSQL-->>ExpressAPI: Storage failure
            ExpressAPI-->>ReactChatUI: Send error and retained composer draft
        else Message persists
            PostgreSQL-->>ExpressAPI: Created message
            ExpressAPI-->>ReactChatUI: Safe message, append and clear draft
        end
    end

    Note over ExpressAPI,PostgreSQL: Planned safe projections exclude account email, password data, OTP codes, and OTP hashes. No chat endpoint paths or channel-membership persistence mechanism exist in the repository yet.

